{"reviewId": "11900993_86jVoBXpI", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "是这么个道理，前十年中国经济已移动互联网为主导。现在经济状况开始以AI、人工智能为主导。中国的发展确实很惊人。我看李飞飞那本书，她提到美国早在1956年开始提出AI这个概念。目前美国的AI技术和中国的AI技术到底处在一个怎么样的差距呢？看李飞飞那本书还提到他们在研发数据的时候，采用了2000万张图片作为一个数据采集。是巨大的数据存储。而目前我们应用的DeepSeek还无法识别图片内容。这个是不是就是差距？", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "3404-3461", "abstract": "一个技术在追赶国的渗透程度达到无孔不入的时候，它一定到达了生命周期的最后阶段，这个技术后面就是一个成熟并衰落的趋势", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 23, "chapterName": "18 演讲实录：人生就是一场康波", "chapterIdx": 23, "reviewId": "11900993_86jVoBXpI", "userVid": 11900993, "topics": [], "createTime": 1768982320, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "18 演讲实录：人生就是一场康波", "author": {"userVid": 11900993, "name": "silver", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Yc2tpkicn7DPlLMZdsHHek3CwRyvJ874QZptc67DlhdpnrJlZhIclv6cuCFZgd7mqt6DT1SZBsMU/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "silver", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20231113-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 15, "likes": [{"userVid": 377289794, "name": "小宇仔 🐟", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0002-UBJ3nWHYj_N~xdO7Q_iUtf8/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "小宇仔 🐟", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "历史，心理，哲理，文学", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-365", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 365}}], "commentsCount": 6, "hotComments": [], "comme